5. Neighbour Table design

5.1 Proposed entry fields

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Field                   Suggested type          Meaning and source
  ----------------------- ----------------------- -----------------------
  nodeID[6]               uint8_t[6]              Unique key from the
                                                  beacon’s six-byte Node
                                                  ID

  lastSeenMs              uint32_t                Local millis() value
                                                  when the last valid
                                                  beacon was accepted

  rssiDbm                 int16_t                 Latest packet RSSI in
                                                  dBm, from the LoRa
                                                  driver

  snrDb                   float or scaled integer Latest packet SNR in
                                                  dB, from the LoRa
                                                  driver, if available

  latitude                int32_t                 Latitude encoded
                                                  according to the
                                                  existing beacon format

  longitude               int32_t                 Longitude encoded
                                                  according to the
                                                  existing beacon format

  heading                 uint16_t or existing    Heading using the exact
                          packet type             scale in the existing
                                                  beacon format

  speed                   uint16_t or existing    Speed using the exact
                          packet type             unit in the existing
                                                  beacon format

  lastSequence            Existing sequence type  Last accepted sequence
                                                  number from this
                                                  neighbour

  packetsReceived         uint32_t                Number of valid, newly
                                                  processed beacon
                                                  packets counted by the
                                                  estimator

  packetsLost             uint32_t                Estimated missing
                                                  sequence numbers under
